			<div class="content" id="post-content-1834867">
									

<p>I don't really understand the containment procedures.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>In all instances, SCP-1911 continues to occupy the residence until the target expires <strong>or leaves for an extended period of time</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p>So wouldn't it make more sense (and be more ethical) to simply abduct and imprison the target for some time, then give them amnesiacs, instead of re-enacting Sloth's fate from <em>Se7en</em> with them?</p>

