<p>Unless the grandmas, when left alone, draw way too much attention to themselves, there's no reason to keep the guy imprisoned in his own home (where, as the article notes, it's hard to keep him inside without restraining him indefinitely) instead of just kidnapping him and keeping him somewhere in a cell (or, heck, tricking him into going on a lengthy vacation somewhere) until the grannies vanish.<br />
