<p>Say &#8212; now that I think about it, why won't the Foundation target the grandmas themselves? Once infestation occurs, just send in men who will overpower and take away the &quot;escaped elderly dementia patients&quot; &#8212; they're just harmless old women, they don't exhibit super strength, they don't indefinitely keep teleporting back. So there's even less reason to harass the <em>victim</em>.</p>

